{
  "id": "E099",
  "title": "How is the weather today?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-03-18",
  "synopsis": "Paul and Lin Hong talk about tomorrow’s weather forecast.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/368/c6c127853a0d812ff08ab798cba23af70a18325d.mp3?1489436740",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "今天天气怎么样？\n\n保罗：今天天气怎么样？\n林红：今天白天是阴天，气温13到20度。\n保罗：明天呢？\n林红：明天下雨，气温10度左右。明天会有点冷，不过后天就是晴天了。\n保罗：你怎么都知道？\n林红：我每天都看天气预报。",
    "traditional": "今天天氣怎麼樣？\n\n保羅：今天天氣怎麼樣？\n林紅：今天白天是陰天，氣溫13到20度。\n保羅：明天呢？\n林紅：明天下雨，氣溫10度左右。明天會有點冷，不過後天就是晴天了。\n保羅：你怎麼都知道？\n林紅：我每天都看天氣預報。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How is the weather today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：今天天气怎么样？",
      "traditional": "保羅：今天天氣怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó jīn tiān tiān qì zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: How is the weather today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "林红：今天白天是阴天，气温13到20度。",
      "traditional": "林紅：今天白天是陰天，氣溫13到20度。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng jīn tiān bái tiān shì yīn tiān qì wēn 2 dào 2 dù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: It’s cloudy today during the daytime, and the temperature will be 13-20 degrees Celsius."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：明天呢？",
      "traditional": "保羅：明天呢？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó míng tiān ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: How about tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "林红：明天下雨，气温10度左右。",
      "traditional": "林紅：明天下雨，氣溫10度左右。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng míng tiān xià yǔ qì wēn 1 dù zuǒ yòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "明天会有点冷，不过后天就是晴天了。",
      "traditional": "明天會有點冷，不過後天就是晴天了。",
      "pinyin": "míng tiān huì yǒu diǎn lěng bú guò hòu tiān jiù shì qíng tiān le",
      "english": "Lin Hong: It will be raining tomorrow, and the temperature will be around 10 degrees Celsius."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Tomorrow will be a bit cold, but the day after tomorrow will be sunny."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "保罗：你怎么都知道？",
      "traditional": "保羅：你怎麼都知道？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ zěn me dōu zhī dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: How do you know all this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "林红：我每天都看天气预报。",
      "traditional": "林紅：我每天都看天氣預報。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng wǒ měi tiān dōu kàn tiān qì yù bào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: I watch the weather forecast every day."
    }
  ],
